  "title": "Amur paradise flycatcher",
  "extract": "The Amur paradise flycatcher is a bird species in the family Monarchidae.\nIt is native to China and Primorsky Krai in the Russian Far East. It is a winter migrant to Southeast Asia. Until 2015, it was considered as a subspecies of the Asian paradise flycatcher.",
